2026-10-04T19:12:34.1248907Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1356771Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1368291Z [0m
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1368987Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1369751Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1370739Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1371160Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1372099Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1372678Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1373031Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1373773Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1374103Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1374769Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1375715Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1376430Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1376830Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1377020Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1377214Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1378075Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1378446Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1379203Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1379481Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1379695Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1380009Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1380595Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1382831Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1391581Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1391792Z I will:
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1392138Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1392493Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1393079Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1393555Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1393990Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1394311Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1394896Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1395332Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1395781Z    /root
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1407983Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1409025Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1420471Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1421288Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1421583Z 
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1422730Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-04T19:12:34.1423436Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
